Stop fetching feeds. Items already archived stay searchable; add the feed
again to resume it.

Usage:
  msgvault source feeds remove <url>... [flags]

Examples:
  msgvault source feeds remove https://example.com/releases.atom

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for remove

Global Flags: --agent-allow-insecure, --agent-token-file, --agent-url, --config, --home, --local, --log-file, --log-level, --log-sql, --log-sql-slow-ms, --no-log-file, -v/--verbose (see 'msgvault --help')
